Google Document AI Discovery resources
=====================================

The two google-document-ai-discovery-*.json files are unmodified Google Cloud
Document AI Discovery responses retrieved on 2026-09-19, revision 20260915.
Original URLs, byte counts, SHA-256 checksums, and the complete method inventory
are recorded in google-document-ai-inventory.json.

