Google API use is separately subject to Google's applicable service terms.

The google-document-ai-openapi-*.json files are Qore-generated OpenAPI 3.0.3
descriptions derived from these documents. They are NOT Google-published
OpenAPI documents. tools/google-discovery-openapi.py defines normalization
boundary version 1. tools/google-document-ai-import.py defines reviewed
Document AI action selection, metadata/result alternatives, and pruning.
Run `python3 tools/google-document-ai-import.py --check` from the source tree
to verify exact reproducibility. Neither importer performs network requests.

